  "body": [
    "Reply and Microsoft are hosting an event entirely dedicated to Microsoft 365 E7, the new enterprise suite designed for the AI Frontier era.",
    "Microsoft 365 E7 brings together productivity, security, digital identity, and advanced AI capabilities in a single integrated solution, combining Microsoft 365 E5, Copilot, Entra Suite, and Agent 365.",
    "Built to accelerate AI transformation at scale, E7 empowers organizations to deploy intelligent agents and AI-powered experiences with enterprise-grade security, governance, and control across the entire digital ecosystem.",
    "Reply and Microsoft are bringing a new vision for enterprise AI to the stage with the introduction of Microsoft 365 E7, the Frontier Suite designed to unify advanced productivity, digital identity, security, and agent governance within a single integrated platform.",
    "Hosted at Microsoft’s Envisioning Theater in Milan on September 22, 2026, this exclusive event offers a unique opportunity to discover how organizations can prepare for the next frontier of artificial intelligence and unlock the full potential of AI at scale.",
    "Exclusive invitation-only event with limited attendance. Participation is subject to approval.",
    "Sold-out Event",
    "Organizations across every industry are looking to embed AI into everyday work at scale. To support this transformation, Microsoft introduces its Frontier Suite.",
    "Microsoft 365 E7 marks a significant evolution in enterprise technology strategy, placing AI at the core of the platform rather than treating it as an optional add-on.",
    "E7 – The Ultimate Journey explores this transformation through Reply’s experience supporting organizations that are integrating people and AI agents to accelerate productivity, innovation, and business growth.",
    "Together, we will explore the most impactful opportunities to reshape the workplace and unlock new sources of value.",
    "The event delivers an immersive Microsoft 365 E7 experience, showcasing a unified approach that brings together Microsoft 365 E5, Copilot, Entra Suite, and Agent 365 to provide the highest levels of intelligence, security, governance, and trust.",
    "Through real-world scenarios, use cases, live demonstrations, and discussions with Microsoft and Reply experts, attendees will discover how to build a scalable, governed AI strategy capable of delivering measurable value across the entire organization.",
    "09:30 - 10:00 | Registration & Welcome",
    "10:00 - 10:30 | OpeningWelcome remarks from Reply and Microsoft.",
    "10:30 - 11:00 | AI Frontier - VisionExploring the transition from AI assistants to Frontier Firms, where people lead teams of AI agents capable of orchestrating work processes, collaborating and continuously learning.",
    "11:00 - 11:15 | Coffee Break",
    "11:15 - 12:30 | Reply's ApproachReply supports organizations throughout the entire technological evolution journey, from strategy definition to solution adoption.",
    "12:30 - 13:00 | Customer Testimonials — E7 JourneyHow Reply supports organizations throughout their transformation journey, from strategy definition and technology adoption to the implementation of AI-powered solutions at scale.",
    "13.00- 14:30 | Lunch",
    "14:30 -15:00 | Microsoft 365 Copilot & AgentsSpeaker: Federica Didonna",
    "15:00 - 15:30 | Secure your DataSpeaker: Feliciano Intini",
    "15:30 -16:00 | Secure and Govern AI & IdentitySpeaker: Michela Lecce",
    "16.00- 18:30 | Networking & AperitivoMeet Microsoft and Reply experts, explore dedicated booths and solution desks.",
    "Discover how to lay the foundations for a new generation of intelligent enterprises. This event is designed for CIOs, IT leaders, security professionals, and innovation decision-makers who want to understand how to turn artificial intelligence into a tangible competitive advantage.",
    "Build a secure and scalable AI Frontier strategy",
    "Gain a clear vision of how productivity, digital identity, security, and agentic AI are evolving to shape the future of work.",
    "Experience Microsoft 365 E7 firsthand",
    "Explore the Frontier Suite that is redefining how organizations adopt, govern, and scale AI across the enterprise.",
    "Gain exclusive insights from Microsoft and Reply",
    "Engage directly with experts on governance, security, compliance, and the organizational transformation required to unlock the full value of AI.",
    "Define your organization's AI roadmap",
    "Learn from real-world experiences, transformation journeys, and practical next steps to accelerate your company's evolution toward an AI-powered future.",
    "Discover the full potential of Microsoft 365 E7 and learn how to move from vision to activation.",
    "Exclusive invitation-only event with limited attendance. Participation is subject to approval.",
    "Sold-out Event"
  ],
